msgstr "改正填写错误后才能继续预览（保存时会标出错误）"

# 编辑页：检查和内容指标
msgid "Toggle checks"
msgstr "显示或隐藏检查"

msgid "Checks"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "Show issue"
msgstr "查看问题"

msgid "Content metrics"
msgstr "内容指标"

msgid "Words"
msgstr "字数"

msgid "Reading time"
msgstr "阅读时间"

msgid "Readability"
msgstr "可读性"

msgid "This data explained"
msgstr "这些数据怎么来的"

msgid "How we calculate our metrics"
msgstr "指标的计算方法"

msgid ""
"We extract the main content from the page preview, remove all formatting, "
"and calculate the number of words."
msgstr "从页面预览里取出正文，去掉所有格式，再统计字数。"

msgid ""
"We calculate reading time from word count, using different reading speeds "
"for different languages."
msgstr "按字数估算阅读时间，不同语言按不同的阅读速度算。"

msgid ""
"We use a readability formula based on length of words and sentences. Long "
"sentences and words result in a worse readability score."
msgstr "按词和句子的长度计算可读性，句子和词越长，分数越差。"

msgid ""
"See our <a href=\"%(guide_link)s\" target=\"_blank\">content checks guide</a> "
"for more information on how content metrics are calculated."
msgstr "指标怎么算，详见<a href=\"%(guide_link)s\" target=\"_blank\">内容检查指南</a>（英文）。"

